{
  "description": "A single upright bird with a penguin-like body is shown in right-facing profile standing on a small patch of ground with sparse grass and tiny flowers. The body is stout and vertical with a white and pale yellow chest and belly, a black head and beak, and a tan back, sides, and flipper densely covered in black spots. The head is black on top with a bright yellow patch on the side of the neck extending from behind the eye to the upper chest, a small dark eye, and a long slender black beak with a slight hook at the tip. The back and the one visible flipper are tan with numerous irregular black rosette-like spots, the flipper edged with thin white and black lines. The chest is white with a yellow-orange wash on the upper breast and a vertical black stripe along the side where the white meets the spotted back. The tail is short and pointed with black feathers at the tip, and the legs and feet are thick, scaly, and pinkish-gray with dark claws. The background is plain off-white.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "black feathered head with a glossy crown, a small dark eye, a bright yellow patch on the side of the neck behind the eye, and a long slender black beak with a slightly down-curved tip pointing to the right",
      "where": "at the top of the body, facing right"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "two short thick legs with wrinkled scaly pinkish-gray skin",
      "where": "at the bottom of the torso, supporting the upright body"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "two large webbed feet with three forward toes each, scaly pinkish-gray skin and dark curved claws at the tips",
      "where": "at the ends of the legs, standing on the ground patch"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "short pointed tail with tan spotted base feathers and a tuft of stiff black feathers at the tip extending backward",
      "where": "at the rear lower end of the body"
    },
    {
      "part": "wings",
      "looks_like": "one visible flipper-like wing, tan with dense black spots and a thin white and black trailing edge, folded flat against the side of the body",
      "where": "on the side of the torso, mid-body, extending from shoulder toward the belly"
    },
    {
      "part": "feathers",
      "looks_like": "dense short feathers covering the whole body; white and fluffy on the chest and belly, yellow-orange on the upper chest and neck side, black on the head and as a stripe along the chest side, tan with black spots on the back and wing, and black stiff feathers on the tail tip",
      "where": "covering the entire body from head to tail and wing"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "numerous irregular black spots and rosettes scattered over a tan background on the back, sides, and wing; a solid bright yellow auricular patch on the side of the head/neck; a solid black vertical stripe along the side of the chest; and a yellow-orange wash on the upper breast",
      "where": "spotted markings over the dorsal side and wing, yellow patch on the neck side, black stripe at the junction of white chest and spotted side, orange wash on upper chest"
    }
  ],
